{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは、渡辺です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/05/03/7393638/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間は名古屋にて\n全握、個握がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/05/03/7393638/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペアはみなみさんと♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみさんのファンの皆様\nそしてみりり委員会の皆様\nありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふわ〜と楽しめました(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の日は個握！安定の楽しさ！！\n今回1.2部共に巫女さんの格好を\nしました〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/05/03/7393638/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似合っていますかね...？(o_o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎みりターン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛知のコウジ（のぎざか会）さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・名古屋のイメージってどんな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→元気で明るいイメージがあります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほしこうさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・握手会にいくときに\nワックス付けてなかったら好感度上がる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→私の口が足らず勘違させて\nしまった方々が多くて、、\nワックス付けてる人が\n嫌いなわけではないですよ(^ ^)\n勘違いさせてしまったらごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"になたんたんさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・新しいマスカラを買おうと\n思うんだけどみり愛愛用の物あるかな？\n銘柄とか売ってる場所とか教えて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/05/03/7393638/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても使いやすくて私のお友達にも\n教えてあげたら好評でしたよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LOFT、PLAZA、IT'S DEMOなどで\n売っていると思います(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠征ドライバーのユウダイさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・東北で一番美味しかったものはなあに？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→牛タンとせんべい汁♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けーかりん（みりりん命名）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・前回の握手会で友達と\n双子してたのですが気が付きましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→もちろん！可愛いかったです(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りょっちょさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛さんには強く願っていることや\n願い事ってありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→あるけど......内緒(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のみりあんさーは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなたが初めて握手したのは\n誰ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1位 七瀬さん\n2位 深川さん\n3位 白石さん\n4位 生田さん\n5位 優里さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○素敵で賞○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まうやんさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・初めて握手したのは\n乃木坂で知り合った方と\n握手会の直前にしたのが初めての握手でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかっぴさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→試合の対戦相手の方が試合に\n負けちゃったんだけど\n終わった後お互いの健闘を讃えて握手したこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のみりあんさーは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイスクリーム食べるとしたら\n抹茶、チョコ、バニラ、ストロベリー\nどれが1番好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パッと答えられるような\nちょっと息抜きというか\nそんな質問にしてみました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにはいいですよね(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントお待ちしてます〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"５月のお誕生日の方々教えて下さい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"４月のお誕生の方々少々お待ち下さいね(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/05/03/7393638/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎告知◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・発売中 月刊エンタメさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメラについて語っています\nぜひ見ていただけたら嬉しいです(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3周年アルバム、ファンの方々が\n作っていただいた物を\n受け取りました(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一つ一つのメッセージ\n大事に読ませていただいています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深川さんのブログに私の寝顔写真が...\nまったくもう(o_o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも嬉しかったです♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回写真載せますね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}